type: software
title: >-
  仿生自适应网络：芯片散热通道树的生成、对照与缺陷台账
  (Bionic adaptive network: generation, comparison and defect ledger of chip
  heat-dissipation channel trees)
abstract: >-
  Generator, comparison framework and defect ledger for tree-shaped bionic
  microchannel chip cooling networks, including the solver, scan scripts,
  MATLAB cross-validation scripts and all numerical artefacts reported in the
  accompanying manuscript. Code is released under the MIT licence; data and
  documentation are released under CC BY 4.0 (see LICENSE and LICENSE-DATA).
  Third-party material is not distributed with this repository.
